# datasets/ (owner V1, 2026-09-28): the JSON, JSONL and Markdown files are public; the audio
# clips never enter git or its history ("I don't want my audio clips randomly sitting in the
# cloud of microsoft"). A JSON file may name a clip's path; the clip itself stays local.
datasets/**
!datasets/**/
!datasets/**/*.json
!datasets/**/*.jsonl
!datasets/**/*.md
